Codec Jokes – How to Use

1. Make sure you have Python 3 installed.


2. Put all files in the same folder:

codec_jokes.py (the program)

randomJokes.txt (your jokes)

Faces/1.jpg … Faces/8.jpg (caller images)

BGM.mp3 (background music)

Codec.wav (joke sound)

Laugh.wav (punchline laugh)

Icon.ico (app icon)



3. Run codec_jokes.py with Python.


4. Click buttons to interact:

ALEXA TELL ME A JOKE – Shows a new joke and plays a joke sound.

SHOW PUNCHLINE – Shows the punchline and plays a laugh.

NEXT JOKE – Skips to a new joke.

QUIT – Closes the app.



5. Each joke in randomJokes.txt should be written as:

Setup?Punchline


6. Enjoy the jokes with faces and sounds!